# Git line ending normalization
# -----------------------------
# Forces LF for all text files regardless of contributor's `core.autocrlf` setting.
# Without this, Windows users get CRLF in their working tree, Prettier rewrites
# to LF, and `format:check` in CI (Ubuntu, LF) bounces forever.
#
# `* text=auto eol=lf` says:
#   - Auto-detect text vs binary.
#   - For text: store with LF in the repo AND check out with LF on every OS.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary types — never normalize these
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
